              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mark T. Stancil, petitioner argues that pre\u2011trial motion preparation time is not automatically excluded under \u00a73161(h)(1) and must be evaluated case\u2011by\u2011case under \u00a73161(h)(7)."
        },
        {
