              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 54,
                "start": 54
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mark T. Stancil (Petitioner), according to Mark T. Stancil (Petitioner), petitioner notes that subparagraph (h) automatically excludes up to 30\u202fdays of district\u2011court advisement, but the status of the 31st day is uncertain."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mark T. Stancil (Petitioner)",
          "citations": [
            {
