              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-c9dafb32d72e-0002-0012"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 55,
                "start": 55
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mark T. Stancil (Petitioner), according to Mark T. Stancil (Petitioner), petitioner points to \u00a73161(h)(7)(C), which treats defense\u2011counsel requests differently from government\u2011counsel requests regarding end\u2011of\u2011justice exclusions."
        }
      ],
